[5.138021, "o", "\u001b[1m$ ros2-project-gen init my_robot --template minimal_ros2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.64566, "o", "Project 'my_robot' created at: ./my_robot\r\n\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n  \u001b[1mNext steps for\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mminimal_ros2\u001b[0m\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n\r\n  1. Source ROS 2 environment:\r\n     source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.zsh\r\n\r\n  2. Build the workspace (C++ and Python packages):\r\n     cd my_robot/ros2_ws && colcon build\r\n\r\n  3. Source the workspace:\r\n     source install/setup.zsh\r\n\r\n"]
[5.645806, "o", "  4. Launch all nodes (C++ + Python + bringup):\r\n     ros2 launch my_robot_bringup bringup.launch.py\r\n\r\n  5. Test individual nodes:\r\n     ros2 run my_robot_cpp talker\r\n     ros2 run my_robot_python talker\r\n\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n"]
